---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead
      title="About Bernardo — bcruz97"
      description="About Bernardo Cruz and why I started this blog: a place for opinions, rabbit holes, and whatever has my attention."
    />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main id="main" class="wrap notebook-layout">
      <aside class="margin-notes">
        <p class="margin-name">About</p>
        <p class="margin-bio"><a class="underlined" href="/blog/">Read the blog</a></p>
        <p class="margin-footnote">Portuguese, native<br />English</p>
      </aside>
      <article class="notebook-content about-page">
        <h1>I’m Bernardo Cruz.</h1>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>I’m 29, from the Lisbon area in Portugal. I’ve been coding since around 2014 and have about five years of corporate experience in software development and DevOps.</p>
          <p>I tend to fall down rabbit holes. Something catches my attention, I keep digging, and eventually I want to tell someone everything I’ve found out or share an opinion I can’t stop thinking about.</p>
          <p>That’s why I started this blog. Instead of sending someone a wall of messages, I can put those thoughts here for anyone who feels like reading them. Whatever is on my mind, if I feel the need to talk about it, this is where it goes.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
